WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.030
Choose a reachable destination after the earned reward.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.700
Travel to the selected Opportunity.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.170
The Opportunity reveal cycles through its outcomes.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.500
Hidden Spring restores 19 HP: 181 to 200.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.710
Continue returns to the map with the completed node and 200 HP.
